{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 的纵向交替和密集的感受词会增加视线移动与信息筛选的负担，初次扫屏不如 Y 的左右分栏直观。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分栏有明显的扫读优势，叙述和感受分区明确，但右侧感受词往往集中呈现，音乐中的情绪变化容易被压缩成一组静态标签。X 虽然更密集，却通过【】突出叙事关键点，并让感受词随音乐进程出现，既保留了人物从不甘、怀念、孤独到逐渐自我接纳的心理因果，也呈现了旋律、舞步、旧歌等意象的反复变化。尤其在细腻程度上，X 能区分相似情绪背后的不同身体反应、音乐动作和心理转折，整体更有层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4a8fb661-4332-4e85-b503-60d28866e6e5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005503082741Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.75, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:55:54.845142+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fd770add8974667c81b788a3191e1546e23f2cc3f804538d64a7fbed7134be94", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\